# ITER positive turbulence using four-scale FFT convolution on a 2048 x 4096 grid.
# Smooth nonnegative grid reconstruction; extra center clearance preserves the wall gap.
# Same mesh, timestep, projection quadrature and solvers as the SI-BDF2 FFT preset,
# integrated with SI-BDF3 (Richardson SI-Euler, then SI-BDF2 startup steps).
--preset positive_turbulence_iter_fft_si_bdf3_p6_h014_dt0005_t50_raw_cuda_bsr
